/target
__pycache__/
# Ledgers are per-session and per-machine. `.vouch/registry.toml` is authored context and
# belongs in the repository, so only the ledger directory is ignored. The pattern needs the
# leading `**/` because a slash anywhere but the end anchors a pattern to the repository root,
# and every ledger here is nested under examples/ or tests/.
**/.vouch/ledger/

# Which eval runs already finished, so --resume does not pay for them twice.
# Local progress, like the ledger: never shared, and meaningless on another machine.
**/.vouch/eval/
